        "l": 144.00002,
        "t": 699.12184,
        "r": 535.9600200000002,
        "b": 675.88184
      },
      "content": "The mechanical seal used in an Ex-classified environment must be properly certified. Prior to startup, make sure that all areas that could leak pumped fluid to the work environment are closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1762",
      "reading_order": 2050,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00008,
        "t": 651.9863799999999,
        "r": 187.45007999999999,
        "b": 640.74638
      },
      "content": "NOTICE:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1763",
      "reading_order": 2051,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00008,
        "t": 637.46638,
        "r": 542.4101000000003,
        "b": 614.22638
      },
      "content": "The mechanical seal must have an appropriate seal-flush system. Otherwise, excess heat generation and seal failure can occur."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1764",
      "reading_order": 2052,
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00008,
        "t": 604.66639,
        "r": 268.69007999999997,
        "b": 593.42639
      },
      "content": "Assemble the seal chamber."
    },
